1
00:00:00,714 --> 00:00:02,294
(Penny:)Can you please come get him?

2
00:00:02,966 --> 00:00:05,966
Uh, yeah, I'd be happy to, Penny.

3
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:07,841
[HOWARD IMITATES ALARM]

4
00:00:08,012 --> 00:00:10,512
LEONARD: Oh, my God,
there's a breach in the radiation unit.

5
00:00:10,682 --> 00:00:12,102
(Leonard:)The whole city is in jeopardy.

6
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:15,807
Oh, my God. Professor Guggenheim
is melting. Gotta go. Bye.

7
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:25,320
- I feel really guilty.
RAJESH: You did what you had to do.

8
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:28,578
HOWARD [IMITATES CHARLTON HESTON]:
Take your stinking paws off my popcorn...

9
00:00:28,742 --> 00:00:31,662
(Howard:)...you damn dirty ape.

10
00:00:35,915 --> 00:00:37,795
(Sheldon:)Thanks for bringing me home.

11
00:00:37,959 --> 00:00:40,209
(Penny:)Oh, it's okay.
I didn't really need to work today.

12
00:00:40,378 --> 00:00:43,258
(Penny:)It's not like I have rent
or car payments or anything.

13
00:00:43,423 --> 00:00:45,463
(Sheldon:)Good, good.

14
00:00:46,718 --> 00:00:48,718
(Penny:)Okay, well, you feel better.

15
00:00:48,887 --> 00:00:51,217
(Sheldon:)Wait. Where are you going?

16
00:00:51,848 --> 00:00:55,898
Um, home to write some bad checks.

17
00:00:56,853 --> 00:00:58,143
(Sheldon:)You're going to leave me?

18
00:00:58,688 --> 00:01:02,018
(Penny:)Sheldon, you are a grown man.
Haven't you ever been sick before?

